        "Title": "The bomb. 9. Bankok.",
        "Location": "LOCATION_BANGKOK_ZIKA",
        "PublicId": "116607012220",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Bangkok/scene_zika.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f4001b55-ed43-4654-918a-4c1377ed9f67).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Now we are back here at Bankok. I thought we are just going to sleep until the next morning, but i just getted a word than world wide singer Harrington Mcdonald and her wife have just landed here at Bankok, and trying to get in her room. Their room is not ready, so he and her wife spends her time in the lobby, at the reception. The next target is the old ICA agent Victor Huttingdon. We don&apos;t need Huttingdon anymore because he&apos;s already done his job. Good luck agent. Have fun!",
